Migration Types :
-----------------
Greenfield → Build fresh in CPI.
Brownfield → Lift-and-shift migration.
Bluefield → Tool-driven + optimized mix of green & brown.
Hybrid → Manual mix of fresh + migrated.
Manual → Developer rebuilds manually.
Automated → Using SAP tools.
Selective → Only active/critical interfaces.
Phased → Step-by-step migration.

